import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 112 | Realm Refinement · Condensed Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 112 | Realm Refinement · Condensed Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","no":112,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Condensed Origin Realm","Cultivation Risks","Breakthrough Costs","Alaya Supervision"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Laws","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0112_模块1-凝元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md","filePath":"en/0112_模块1-凝元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"}'),o={name:"en/0112_模块1-凝元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,h){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-112-condensed-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 112 | Condensed Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-112-condensed-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 112 | Condensed Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 19, 15, 27</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-whether-the-circulation-is-built-well-supervision-watches-for-you" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Whether the circulation is built well, supervision watches for you <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-whether-the-circulation-is-built-well-supervision-watches-for-you" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Whether the circulation is built well, supervision watches for you&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Condensed Realm puts energy truly into the body for the first time; risks also fall from &quot;invisible perceptual layers&quot; to &quot;concrete silting layers.&quot; The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision&#39;s task in this realm is more concrete than the Sense Origin Realm (Entry 105): not just warning of perceptual confusion, but real-time monitoring of whether every internal circulation is healthy and every purity metric meets standard.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the value origin of the supervision mechanism: the anti-predation axiom — the first mission of supervision is to make predation nowhere to hide; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — supervision treats all Myriad Races equally; the collective ascension axiom — guarding every healthy circulation is guarding civilizational assets; the causal self-discipline axiom — condensation does not disturb the causality of others or the environment; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of Condensed Realm supervision is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-four-core-risks-of-the-condensed-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Four Core Risks of the Condensed Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-core-risks-of-the-condensed-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Core Risks of the Condensed Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Energy silting and diversion: forcing practice before circuits are open causes energy to silt into blockages; minor stagnation, major local backlash</li><li>Circulation rupture: the internal circulation is most fragile in its early stage; emotion or trauma can stop it, causing energy backflow</li><li>Purity leakage: absorbing energy with impurities or residual will traces contaminates the circulation, laying hidden wounds of &quot;impure origin&quot;</li><li>Shortcut inner demon: the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon&#39;s typical form in this realm is &quot;swallow a pill and strip a ring to instantly open circulation&quot; — Path D · Humanoid Artificial Dao-Rule Soul Rings are precisely born to end this path</li></ol><h2 id="ii-breakthrough-costs-real-but-controllable-and-reversible" tabindex="-1">II. Breakthrough Costs: Real, But Controllable and Reversible <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-breakthrough-costs-real-but-controllable-and-reversible" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Breakthrough Costs: Real, But Controllable and Reversible&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Breaking through from the Condensed Realm to the Transform Realm requires real costs:</p><ul><li>Time cost: normal path takes months to years (Document 14); compressing time necessarily costs higher risk</li><li>Resource cost: basic resources are allocated by the contracted responsibility system, more work more gain, eliminating monopoly and freeloading</li><li>Purity cost: repeatedly tempering to reach purity standard; time cannot be skipped</li><li>Failure cost: breakthrough failure triggers backlash, but anchor monitoring and repair mechanisms ensure failure is reversible</li></ul><p>The core principle holds: costs must be real, or growth has no weight; but predatory-style &quot;one false step, eternal regret&quot; is never allowed.</p><h2 id="iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision-closed-loop" tabindex="-1">III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision Closed Loop <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision-closed-loop" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision Closed Loop&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Condensed Realm supervision has five layers:</p><ul><li>Anchor automatic monitoring: continuously monitoring circulation efficiency, blockages, purity; anomalies trigger instant warnings (Document 14 certification mechanism)</li><li>Anchor calibration and maintenance: silt channeling and circulation rebuilding are provided as public services by the anchor calibration system (Document 27)</li><li>Ethical review: advanced breakthroughs require ethical review, confirming no predation record and consensus stance</li><li>Anti-Predation Committee: key target is striking spread of &quot;swallow pills strip rings fast-track&quot; heresies</li><li>Publicity objection period: thirty days of publicity, all Myriad Races may raise objections</li></ul><h2 id="iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-condensed-realm" tabindex="-1">IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Condensed Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-condensed-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Condensed Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 19&#39;s ethical principles concretized in this realm:</p><ul><li>Informed consent: any energy sharing and dual cultivation are premised on voluntariness, eliminating &quot;cauldron furnaces&quot;</li><li>Minimum harm: silt is cleared on detection, no contamination discharged to the environment</li><li>Accountability: Condensed Realm cultivators must undertake low-tier community service; power and responsibility advance together</li></ul><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-condensed-realm-hazards-amplify-in-the-transform-realm" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Condensed Realm Hazards Amplify in the Transform Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-condensed-realm-hazards-amplify-in-the-transform-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Condensed Realm Hazards Amplify in the Transform Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The existence value of the supervision system in the Condensed Realm is clearest at cross-realm handover: a blockage not channeled in the Condensed Realm gets amplified in the transformation phase after entering the Transform Realm — because transformation makes energy flow through more complex paths, the blockage point becomes the detonation point of transformation rampage. Similarly, purity leakage left in the Condensed Realm contaminates shaping products during the Transform Realm&#39;s energy-matter interaction. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision therefore list &quot;Condensed Realm residual hazard investigation&quot; as a mandatory item before Transform Realm breakthrough: the anchor automatically pulls up the cultivator&#39;s full Condensed Realm circulation and purity records; any unrepaired hidden wound must be repaired before passage. This rule seems to &quot;stall progress,&quot; but actually saves the cultivator from repaying double in the future — the ascension pattern of the five mortal-cultivation realms tells us: homework skipped at lower realms is always collected with interest at higher realms.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: supervision keeps every circulation healthy, not wasting talent on silting and qi deviation</li><li>Anti-predation: striking &quot;swallow pills strip rings&quot; at the source, nailing the shortcut inner demon in the second realm</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system had no supervision network; under patronage, undercurrents flowed; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s openness comes with full-stack guardianship</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: supervision treats 99% of Myriad Races equally; planetary star-core circulations are equally monitored by anchors</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: every link of openness is paired with guardianship; openness and safety are never a single-choice question</li></ul><p>It is worth emphasizing: this &quot;mandatory residual hazard investigation&quot; is not bureaucratic process-blocking, but the anti-predation axiom landing directly at the supervision layer: predatory cultivators are best at exploiting &quot;no one checks last realm&#39;s hazards&quot; to continue doing evil; the symbiotic faction puts every realm&#39;s hidden wounds in the open precisely to leave no corner for old heresies. The Alaya Network&#39;s full-stack guardianship is essentially extending the promise of &quot;everyone has a path&quot; to &quot;every pit on the path is filled by someone.&quot;</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Condensed Realm&#39;s supervisory philosophy remains the same: control risks, keep costs real, keep the road open. Silt can be channeled, circulation rebuilt, costs reversible — Myriad Race cultivators have, for the first time beyond &quot;absolute safety&quot; and &quot;false safety,&quot; a third choice of steadily growing stronger amid real costs.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Laws</a> · <a href="./27-锚点校准与维护.html">27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
